19	
20	  Page structure and interaction pattern adapted from the team's own course
21	  material (mlsyscourse/slides-modern-gpu-programming,
22	  data-layout/site/demo/tile_distributed.html). TIRx layout logic in
23	  layout-demo.js is original. Not derived from any third-party demo.
